{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16884","headline":"塞下曲 · 武元衡","name":"塞下曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草枯马蹄轻，角弓劲如石。\n骄虏初欲来，风尘暗南国。\n走檄召都尉，星火剿羌狄。\n吾身许报主，何暇避锋镝。\n白露湿铁衣，半夜待攻击。\n龙沙早立功，名向燕然勒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}